Date: Wed, 12 Mar 2025 16:42:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 65/91] LOONGARCH64: Replace "or CARG1, L, r0" with "mv CARG1,
 L" to improve code readability

---
 src/vm_loongarch64.dasc | 238 ++++++++++++++++++++--------------------
 1 file changed, 120 insertions(+), 118 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/vm_loongarch64.dasc b/src/vm_loongarch64.dasc
